  "body": "Positioned in one of Takapuna's most tightly held streets, this brand-new architecturally designed residence delivers a lifestyle that is bold, sophisticated, and unmistakably different.\r\n\r\nDesigned with flexibility in mind, these homes offer two generous bedrooms plus a versatile lounge with its own ensuite and wardrobe-easily functioning as a third bedroom for growing families, guests, or multi-generational living. Unlike many standard townhouses, this intelligent layout adapts to your lifestyle without compromising on space or comfort.\r\n\r\nLevel one is the true heart of the home. A beautifully designed open-plan kitchen, dining, and living space flows seamlessly together, creating an atmosphere perfect for entertaining or relaxed coastal living. The designer kitchen showcases premium Miele appliances, integrated fridge solutions, and refined cabinetry that blend flawlessly into the architectural aesthetic. Every detail has been thoughtfully selected to create a clean, sophisticated finish rarely found in today's market.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, two luxurious master suites provide the ultimate sanctuary. One enjoys captivating sea views - the perfect backdrop to begin and end your day in Takapuna.\r\n\r\nWhat truly sets this home apart is its personality. Bold colour combinations and artistic feature tiling in the bathrooms create a sense of individuality rarely seen in new developments. Confident design choices bring warmth, energy, and character into every space - making this home feel curated rather than copied.\r\n\r\nFor added future convenience, there is also an option to install a lift, with quotation available upon request - ideal for multi-generational living or long-term ease.\r\n\r\nBuilt with quality and peace of mind in mind, the home also comes with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, offering reassurance for years to come.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Takapuna Beach, vibrant cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping, and everyday conveniences, this is more than just a new townhouse.\r\n\r\nThis is lifestyle.\r\nThis is statement living.\r\nThis is Takapuna at its finest.\r\n**Photos were taken from different units as reference only**",
